xportRow, home indicator.\nExportRow: horizontal AL, white, radius 16, border, padding 12, gap 12: PDF badge: rounded square #F3EAF6 44 with PDF_File_Icon instance 28 inside; col fill: title Nunito Bold 14 (1 line), date caption 12 faint; right col: size Nunito SemiBold 12 sub. \n\n### 06_Chat_Conversation (hug)\nRoot vertical: StatusBar; HeaderChat (row padding 16/24: menu iconbtn, center col centered: logo 36 + \"Chat Bot AI 4.5\" + \"Premium account\" — actually center block: horizontal logo+texts; export iconbtn right).\nContent column padding 24 gap 20:\n- BubbleYou #1: label \"You\" (caption, right, with avatar? keep text label). Bubble primary, text: the question. Actions: Edit, Copy.\n- BubbleAI #1: label row: logo 20 + \"Chat Bot AI\" caption. Bubble surface with full story text (14px, lh 22). Actions: Copy, Share, Regenerate.\n- BubbleYou #2: purple hair text. Actions: Edit, Copy.\n- BubbleAI #2: label; bubble surface: text \"I'll try to create that...\" + image Gen_Student (width fill ~300, radius 14). Actions: Download, Share, Regenerate.\nBottom: InputBar + HomeIndicator.\n\nActionChip component: horizontal AL hug: icon 14 + label Nunito SemiBold 12; padding 8/10, radius full, border #E3DEE8, fill white, text sub. Instances override icon+label. But icon inside chip instance: I'd need to swap icon component — instance swap is possible if icons are components: set `inst.swapComponent(otherComp)`? For nested instance inside instance, allowed: `nestedInst.swapComponent()`. My ActionChip contains an icon instance placeholder; per usage swapComponent to desired icon + override label text. Swapping nested instances works in plugin API. OK.\n\n### 07_Export_PDF_Sheet (928 fixed)\nBehind: replicate 06 content (static, simplified: same header + first messages) dimmed with black 40% overlay. To avoid duplicating 06 fully, build 07 root as: frame 428×928 clipsContent: layer A: copy of 06's top portion — I'll construct a simplified static column (header + first user