{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":59830,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02196ae582dd0a7a015c4ea4f1d58378","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now build 06_Chat_Conversation. This is the most complex: 4 messages, action rows, image. Layout:\n- chatChrome (menu, export, logo, title, badge)\n- messages start y~170:\n  1. You bubble right: question text. Actions: Edit · Copy\n  2. AI message left: logo mini + name \"Chat Bot AI\"? \"each sender identified\" — for You bubble label \"You\", for AI label \"Chat Bot AI\". Story text truncated. Actions: Copy · Share · Regenerate\n  3. You bubble: image description text. Actions Edit · Copy\n  4. AI: \"I'll try to create that...\" + Gen_Student image + actions Download · Share · Regenerate\n- inputBar at bottom.\n\nSpace: 928 total, bottom input ~78. Content 170→816 = 646. Story is long; \"Long answers may be cut off where the frame ends; everything listed must still be visible.\" So visible items: all 4 messages + action rows must be visible. I need to budget:\n- msg1 (You, 2-line question) ~64 + actions 20 = ~88\n- msg2 (AI story) — show ~6 lines of story ~120 + label/actions = ~190\n- msg3 (You, ~4 lines) ~96 + actions = ~120\n- msg4 (AI text 2 lines ~48 + image 160 + actions) ~260\nTotal ~660. Tight. Reduce: story ~5 lines (90px), image 140. msg4 text 2 lines.\n\nLet me structure each message as a vertical auto-layout flow appended directly to frame with manual y stacking. Actually simpler: create a \"Messages\" frame with VERTICAL auto-layout, itemSpacing 14, width 380, x=24, y=164; then inputBar positioned at bottom. If messages overflow behind input... let me compute after and adjust image size.\n\nMessage structures:\n- YouMsg: label \"You\" (small, right aligned), bubble (primarySoft bg, radius 16, padding 12, text ink 13), actions row (Edit · Copy) with icons+labels, right aligned.\n- AIMsg: row: logo 28 + \"Chat Bot AI\" label; bubble white border; text 13; actions row.\n\nFor actions, icon 13px + label 11px, gap 14.\n\nStory text: use the opening portion: \"Once upon a time, in the quaint town of Meadowville, there lived a spirited high school student named Lily. Lily was known for her enthusiasm for learning and her adventurous spirit. One crisp autumn morning, as she set out for school, little did she know that this ordinary day would turn into an extraordinary adventure.\" — with maxLines maybe 5.\n\nHmm, but data accuracy: the conversation says the AI reply is \"the story\" with full text in 04 Media. I'll include a good chunk (first 2 paragraphs) and let it truncate. Evaluation: \"Data & copy accuracy\" — the exact visible copy is my decision (\"how much of a long answer is visible is your decision\"). So truncation is fine.\n\nLet me write it.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0338c781-78cf-48da-b153-97e8b743ce85","uuid":"e4e7f7be-ef33-456f-8b37-8df6a5048c5e","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:56:06.840Z","thinking_duration_ms":17216}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":59830,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02196ae582dd0a7a015c4ea4f1d58378","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_22_5f9e5853","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"lEwCWXljcAXgGd3yvwjAbG","code":"for (const f of [{family:'Nunito',style:'Regular'},{family:'Nunito',style:'Medium'},{family:'Nunito',style:'SemiBold'},{family:'Nunito',style:'Bold'},{family:'Nunito',style:'ExtraBold'},{family:'Bricolage Grotesque',style:'SemiBold'},{family:'Bricolage Grotesque',style:'Bold'}]) await figma.loadFontAsync(f);\nconst page = figma.currentPage;\nconst byName = n => page.findOne(x=>x.type==='FRAME'&&x.name===n&&x.parent===page);\nconst NUN_REG={family:'Nunito',style:'Regular'}, NUN_MED={family:'Nunito',style:'Medium'}, NUN_SB={family:'Nunito',style:'SemiBold'}, NUN_B={family:'Nunito',style:'Bold'};\nconst BRI_SB={family:'Bricolage Grotesque',style:'SemiBold'};\nfunction txt(chars, font, size, color, opts={}){\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName = font; t.characters = chars; t.fontSize = size;\n  t.fills = [{type:'SOLID',color}];\n  t.lineHeight = opts.lineHeight || {unit:'PERCENT', value: 140};\n  if(opts.width){ t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(opts.width, t.height); } else t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n  if(opts.maxLines){ t.textTruncation='ENDING'; t.maxLines = opts.maxLines; }\n  return t;\n}\nconst C = {\n  ink:{r:0.13,g:0.12,b:0.15}, sub:{r:0.47,g:0.44,b:0.42}, border:{r:0.85,g:0.83,b:0.81},\n  surface:{r:0.965,g:0.955,b:0.95}, primary:{r:0.3804,g:0.1647,b:0.4549},\n  primarySoft:{r:0.945,g:0.905,b:0.955}, white:{r:1,g:1,b:1},\n};\nasync function addShell(frame){\n  const sb = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:7')).createInstance(); frame.appendChild(sb); sb.x=0; sb.y=0;\n  const hi = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:18')).createInstance(); frame.appendChild(hi); hi.x=0; hi.y=928-34;\n}\nasync function chatChrome(f){\n  const menu = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:92')).createInstance(); menu.resize(24,24); f.appendChild(menu); menu.x=20; menu.y=59;\n  const exp = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:96')).createInstance(); exp.resize(24,24); f.appendChild(exp); exp.x=428-20-24; exp.y=59;\n  const logo = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:20')).createInstance(); logo.resize(40,40); f.appendChild(logo); logo.x=(428-40)/2; logo.y=56;\n  const t1 = txt('Chat Bot AI 4.5', BRI_SB, 17, C.ink);\n  f.appendChild(t1); t1.x=(428-t1.width)/2; t1.y=104;\n  const badge = figma.createFrame(); badge.name='PremiumBadge';\n  badge.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; badge.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; badge.itemSpacing=5;\n  badge.paddingLeft=10; badge.paddingRight=10; badge.paddingTop=4; badge.paddingBottom=4;\n  badge.cornerRadius=12; badge.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.primarySoft}];\n  const pi = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:103')).createInstance(); pi.resize(12,12);\n  const bl = txt('Premium account', NUN_SB, 11, C.primary);\n  badge.appendChild(pi); badge.appendChild(bl);\n  f.appendChild(badge); badge.x=(428-badge.width)/2; badge.y=132;\n}\nasync function inputBar(f, y){\n  const bar = figma.createFrame(); bar.name='InputBar';\n  bar.resize(380,56); bar.cornerRadius=28; bar.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.surface}];\n  const ph = txt('Ask me anything...', NUN_REG, 14, C.sub);\n  f.appendChild(bar); bar.x=24; bar.y=y;\n  f.appendChild(ph); ph.x=24+18; ph.y=y+17;\n  const send = figma.createFrame(); send.name='Send'; send.resize(44,44); send.cornerRadius=22;\n  send.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.primary}];\n  f.appendChild(send); send.x=24+380-6-44; send.y=y+6;\n  const sic = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:90')).createInstance(); sic.resize(20,20);\n  f.appendChild(sic); sic.x=24+380-6-44+12; sic.y=y+18;\n}\nasync function actionRow(parent, items, alignRight){\n  const row = figma.createFrame(); row.name='Actions';\n  row.fills=[]; row.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; row.itemSpacing=14;\n  row.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; row.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  for(const [label, iconId] of items){\n    const it = figma.createFrame(); it.name='Act/'+label;\n    it.fills=[]; it.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; it.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; it.itemSpacing=4;\n    it.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; it.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n    const ic = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(iconId)).createInstance(); ic.resize(13,13);\n    const lb = txt(label, NUN_SB, 11, C.sub);\n    it.appendChild(ic); it.appendChild(lb);\n    row.appendChild(it);\n  }\n  parent.appendChild(row);\n  if(alignRight) row.layoutAlign='STRETCH', row.primaryAxisAlignItems='MAX';\n  return row;\n}\nasync function youMsg(parent, text){\n  const m = figma.createFrame(); m.name='Msg/You';\n  m.fills=[]; m.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; m.itemSpacing=5; m.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; m.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; m.resize(380,10);\n  const who = txt('You', NUN_B, 11, C.primary);\n  m.appendChild(who); who.layoutAlign='STRETCH'; who.textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT';\n  const b = figma.createFrame(); b.name='Bubble';\n  b.cornerRadius=16; b.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.primarySoft}];\n  b.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; b.paddingLeft=b.paddingRight=12; b.paddingTop=b.paddingBottom=10;\n  b.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; b.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  const bt = txt(text, NUN_MED, 13, C.ink, {width: 320});\n  b.appendChild(bt);\n  m.appendChild(b); b.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  await actionRow(m, [['Edit','7:74'],['Copy','7:78']], true);\n  parent.appendChild(m);\n  return m;\n}\nasync function aiMsg(parent, text, actions, opts={}){\n  const m = figma.createFrame(); m.name='Msg/AI';\n  m.fills=[]; m.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; m.itemSpacing=5; m.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; m.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; m.resize(380,10);\n  const head = figma.createFrame(); head.name='Sender'; head.fills=[];\n  head.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; head.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; head.itemSpacing=6;\n  head.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; head.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  const lg = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:20')).createInstance(); lg.resize(18,18);\n  const who = txt('Chat Bot AI', NUN_B, 11, C.primary);\n  head.appendChild(lg); head.appendChild(who);\n  m.appendChild(head);\n  const b = figma.createFrame(); b.name='Bubble';\n  b.cornerRadius=16; b.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.white}]; b.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.border}]; b.strokeWeight=1;\n  b.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; b.paddingLeft=b.paddingRight=12; b.paddingTop=b.paddingBottom=10; b.itemSpacing=10;\n  b.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; b.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  const bt = txt(text, NUN_REG, 13, C.ink, {width: 332, maxLines: opts.maxLines||99});\n  b.appendChild(bt);\n  if(opts.imageId){\n    const img = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(opts.imageId)).createInstance();\n    img.resize(332, opts.imageH||150); img.cornerRadius=12;\n    b.appendChild(img);\n  }\n  m.appendChild(b); b.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  await actionRow(m, actions, false);\n  parent.appendChild(m);\n  return m;\n}\n// ---------- 06_Chat_Conversation ----------\n{\n  const f = byName('06_Chat_Conversation');\n  await addShell(f);\n  await chatChrome(f);\n  const msgs = figma.createFrame(); msgs.name='Messages';\n  msgs.fills=[]; msgs.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; msgs.itemSpacing=12;\n  msgs.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; msgs.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; msgs.resize(380,10);\n  await youMsg(msgs, 'Tell me the story of a student who was going to school and some interesting things happened to her on the way.');\n  await aiMsg(msgs, 'Once upon a time, in the quaint town of Meadowville, there lived a spirited high school student named Lily. Lily was known for her enthusiasm for learning and her adventurous spirit. One crisp autumn morning, as she set out for school, little did she know that this ordinary day would turn into an extraordinary adventure. As Lily walked down the familiar path to school, she noticed a peculiar-looking map lying on the ground…', [['Copy','7:78'],['Share','7:81'],['Regenerate','7:83']], {maxLines: 6});\n  await youMsg(msgs, 'What a beautiful story it was! Imagine a student going to school. She has purple hair and shoes. Also, her hat and clothes are yellow and she wears glasses. She has a phone in her left hand.');\n  await aiMsg(msgs, 'I’ll try to create that. Here is the image I generated based on your description. I hope you like it. 😊', [['Download','7:86'],['Share','7:81'],['Regenerate','7:83']], {imageId:'7:27', imageH: 150});\n  f.appendChild(msgs); msgs.x=24; msgs.y=168;\n  await inputBar(f, 928-34-16-56);\n}\n// ---------- 07_Export_PDF_Sheet (06 behind + dim + sheet) ----------\n{\n  const f = byName('07_Export_PDF_Sheet');\n  const bg = byName('06_Chat_Conversation').clone();\n  // flatten children into this frame\n  for(const ch of [...bg.children]) f.appendChild(ch);\n  bg.remove();\n  // dim\n  const dim = figma.createRectangle(); dim.name='Dim'; dim.resize(428,928);\n  dim.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.1,g:0.08,b:0.12}, opacity:0.45}];\n  f.appendChild(dim); dim.x=0; dim.y=0;\n  // sheet\n  const sheet = figma.createFrame(); sheet.name='Sheet';\n  sheet.resize(428, 420); sheet.cornerRadius=24; sheet.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.white}];\n  sheet.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; sheet.paddingLeft=sheet.paddingRight=24; sheet.paddingTop=16; sheet.paddingBottom=28; sheet.itemSpacing=16;\n  f.appendChild(sheet); sheet.x=0; sheet.y=928-420;\n  // grabber\n  const grab = figma.createRectangle(); grab.resize(40,4); grab.cornerRadius=2; grab.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.border}];\n  sheet.appendChild(grab); grab.layoutAlign='CENTER';\n  // header row\n  const hr = figma.createFrame(); hr.name='SheetHeader'; hr.fills=[];\n  hr.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; hr.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; hr.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; hr.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; hr.resize(380,32);\n  const title = txt('Export as PDF', BRI_SB, 18, C.ink);\n  hr.appendChild(title);\n  hr.primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN';\n  const close = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:100')).createInstance(); close.resize(22,22); close.name='Close';\n  hr.appendChild(close);\n  sheet.appendChild(hr);\n  const desc = txt('All your conversations with Chat Bot AI will be exported as PDF. Please choose a title for this file', NUN_REG, 13, C.sub, {width: 380});\n  sheet.appendChild(desc);\n  // PDF icon centered\n  const pdf = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:28')).createInstance(); pdf.resize(56,56);\n  sheet.appendChild(pdf); pdf.layoutAlign='CENTER';\n  // Title field (Text Field instance filled)\n  const tf = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:5')).createInstance();\n  sheet.appendChild(tf); tf.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  const tl = tf.children.find(n=>n.type==='TEXT');\n  tl.fontName=NUN_MED; tl.characters='The story of a student'; tl.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C.ink}];\n  // Export button\n  const btn = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:3')).createInstance();\n  sheet.appendChild(btn); btn.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  btn.children.find(n=>n.type==='TEXT').characters='Export';\n}\nreturn {conv: byName('06_Chat_Conversation').children.length, sheet: byName('07_Export_PDF_Sheet').children.length};","description":"Build 06_Chat_Conversation and 07_Export_PDF_Sheet"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0338c781-78cf-48da-b153-97e8b743ce85","uuid":"77aa3115-bcb0-432c-84f9-1d2979b78998","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:56:46.861Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_22_5f9e5853","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
